# ── Local working notes ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Session hand-off notes. Kept out of the repo deliberately: this is a public
# repository, and the file is a map of the running system — host names, deploy
# paths, which limits sit where. None of that is a credential, but none of it
# needs to be published either.
CONTEXT.md
*.local.md
notes.local/
